+A third result of this version says what happened when the
+whole-window diagnosis was tested directly.  Restricting the same rank-2 fit
+to a nine-bin band at the same TIDMAD window, on new time regions of the same
+files and under two recorded freezes, moved the learned reconstruction from
+the level of predicting zero to below a no-denoising bin read --- the
+dimensional diagnosis confirmed in direction.  Two things then happened that
+the design did not anticipate.  Its block-dependence assessment did not
+stabilise, leaving nine complete blocks, the same limiting count as the
+whole-window stage, so the rule declared before development withheld all three
+benefit verdicts.  And the metric's contribution disappeared: inside a nine-bin
+band the noise PSD is nearly flat (in-band dynamic range $1.2$--$4.7$ against
+$4.8\times10^{4}$ across the window), so band-PCA and band-EMPCA nearly
+coincide.  That is the sharpest statement this paper can make about the
+interaction of its two determinants: on this instrument, the restriction that
+repairs the estimation problem removes most of the geometry's leverage, and a
+band that does both is not among the four tested.
+
