+\end{table}
+
+\paragraph{What else the run records.}
+File \texttt{0016} was eligible-coupled in the whole-window time region and is
+\emph{chirped} in the new one (drift $5.54$ bins against the declared $0.5$); by
+the declared rule it is evaluated, reported and excluded, leaving four eligible
+final-test files --- exactly the declared threshold below which a combined
+interval would have been labelled indicative only.  The inverse-variance
+combination is again dominated by one file ($I^{2}=0.986$), which is why the
+equal-file mean is the primary estimand; the equal-file $t$-interval on the
+point estimates alone includes zero on every contrast while the two-stage
+bootstrap excludes it on three, and both are reported.  \texttt{quadrature-OF}
+reproduces the bin read to $3.8\times10^{-12}$ on every eligible stretch.  $240$
+of a declared cap of $250$ fits were spent.  The full report, including the one
+amendment made on development material and the deterministic re-score that
+followed it, is archived with the run.
